\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We need to create a table of values and then sketch the curve. First, we work out the $x$-values using the formula $x=t-1.$ This gives\n\n| **$t$** | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-4$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nNow, we work out the $y$ values using $y={t}^{2}-5.$ This gives\n\n| **$t$** | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $-4$ | $-3$ | $-2$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| $y$ | $4$ | $-1$ | $-4$ | $-5$ | $-4$ | $-1$ | $4$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nPlotting these points, we obtain the following curve:\n\n![](images/a9/a9d9be86049e1422d9c5c7e4af24992959637c3771503b13f75865840076149b.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259564 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f4bc322-6fd0-5208-91bc-f0e820f30e95" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/65/65ed7c41cad3b1ae44b7563cbf2c41d1472517fcf9d75f42d2938756a3354675.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257035} {:answer/id #uuid "356ffd56-9a71-56e7-b506-9be5799765b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/e5/e5b901a2ab0409d5424c3a9e3a8564cfe94897accec91b8219f634689e16c692.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257253} {:answer/id #uuid "6d672e39-5d5c-5655-9a44-52ca05d96695" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/67/67ae7b5a206f1e85ae3eb69ec335892b83e5bf98f65f496731db389fc869deb1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257743} {:answer/id #uuid "f1699a0b-3288-5123-9c7d-68d6285f29c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a9/a910385d433366abd3788b5903e01aa839e3d9caa6f05a604889102de69649ac.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258883} {:answer/id #uuid "fd23c4c7-be44-56b5-8886-9fd376fb01bc" :